"href=\"%(profile_url)s\" style=\"color: var(--primary-cyan);\">Settings "
"&gt; My Profile</a>. Nothing is needed here."
msgstr ""
"Chaque personne ajoute sa propre clé OpenXBL gratuite dans <a "
"href=\"%(profile_url)s\" style=\"color: var(--primary-cyan);\">Paramètres"
